1
00:00:00,994 --> 00:00:02,034
(Leonard:)What are you doing?

2
00:00:02,245 --> 00:00:04,415
(Sheldon:)I'm trying to raise the temperature
in here...

3
00:00:04,622 --> 00:00:07,372
(Sheldon:)...before my nipples
tear through my shirt.

4
00:00:08,168 --> 00:00:10,838
(Howard:)Why don't you
just turn up the thermostat?

5
00:00:11,046 --> 00:00:12,466
Aha. Good question.

6
00:00:12,672 --> 00:00:16,172
It turns out that the thermostat
for my new office isn't in my new office.

7
00:00:16,384 --> 00:00:19,094
(Sheldon:)No, it's next door
in Professor Davenport's office...

8
00:00:19,304 --> 00:00:22,894
(Sheldon:)...who is currently enjoying the hot
flashes associated with menopause.

9
00:00:24,476 --> 00:00:25,766
(Leonard:)Why is there a hole here?

10
00:00:25,977 --> 00:00:28,067
Why is there a hole in my new office?

11
00:00:28,271 --> 00:00:30,481
l've narrowed it down
to two possibilities.

12
00:00:30,690 --> 00:00:34,400
There was something in the wall
that someone outside the wall wanted.

13
00:00:34,611 --> 00:00:35,901
Or the more disturbing...

14
00:00:36,112 --> 00:00:38,952
...there was something in the wall
that wanted out.

15
00:00:40,742 --> 00:00:43,162
At least you got a window that opens.
That's nice.

